# T21 (Q9): a 4-player Versus load from the menu after the menu warm-up (keyboard A, gamepad,
# keyboard B, gamepad 2 on the focused track), then exit. Same build note as menu_loads.script.
wait ui
wait screen title
50 nav keyboardA confirm           # Title (after the menu warm-up)
wait screen main
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quick Race
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Time Trial
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Versus
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
1.5 nav keyboardA confirm          # P1 joins
0.5 nav gamepad confirm            # P2 joins
0.5 nav keyboardB confirm          # P3 joins
0.5 nav gamepad2 confirm           # P4 joins
0.5 nav keyboardA confirm          # ready ×4 → track select (P1 picks)
0.3 nav gamepad confirm
0.3 nav keyboardB confirm
0.3 nav gamepad2 confirm
wait screen trackSelect
0.5 nav keyboardA confirm          # the focused track: select → Start
0.5 nav keyboardA confirm          # start
wait racing
3.0 exit
